Package: sliR
Title: Standardized Length Index and Allometric Data Simulation
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Aaron", "Skinner", , "skinnerayayron93@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes the Standardized Length Index (SLI) for size-correcting
    appendage lengths, following the scaled mass index approach of Peig and
    Green (2009) <doi:10.1111/j.1600-0706.2009.17643.x>, and simulates
    allometric morphological data with controllable scaling exponents,
    correlation structure, and measurement or transient error.
